  caseSender: Mrs. Peterson
  caseSubject: Please Proof My Points
  caseBody: 'The Case:

    This is the last photograph Endrick took of my son before
    he was lost in the woods. Endrick claims something was there. I have noticed
    this disturbing dark shape in the background, lurking among the trees. I need
    proof that this thing is what took my child, so I can have final peace.'
